 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Possessive",
   "texto": [
    "**Benim** means «mi» and **senin**, «You». The noun receives the termination: **benim annem** (my mother), **senin baban** (your father).",
    "**Onun** means «his / her / her»: **onun kardeşi** (his brother). In a normal phrase, the possessive pronoun can be omitted: **Annem öğretmen** (my mother is a teacher)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Adjectives",
   "texto": [
    "The adjective goes before the name: **büyük aile** (large family), **küçük çocuk** (small child). Adjectives do not change by gender or plural.",
    "**Çok** means «very / very» and goes before the adjective: **çok iyi** (very good / a)."
   ]
  },
